# --- playwright-ui-ux-tester skill ----------------------------------------
# The skill itself (SKILL.md, scripts/, references/) IS committed.
# Local secrets & session state — never commit:
.claude/skills/playwright-ui-ux-tester/local/test-credentials.json
.claude/skills/playwright-ui-ux-tester/local/sessions/
# Test run output (screenshots, diffs, reports) — regenerated every run:
.claude/skills/playwright-ui-ux-tester/out/
# Visual-regression baselines — machine-specific rendering, regenerate locally:
.claude/skills/playwright-ui-ux-tester/baselines/**/*.png
# Eval/benchmark scratch, not shipped with the skill:
.claude/skills/playwright-ui-ux-tester-workspace/
